{"surface": "inspector", "title": "Forecast: China blockades or attacks Taiwan by May 18, 2027", "html": "<header class=\"hero\"><p class=\"kicker\">Forecast</p><div class=\"fig\">3.6%</div><p class=\"ctx\"><a class=\"go\" data-go=\"prop:4\">China blockades or attacks Taiwan by May 18, 2027</a></p></header><div class=\"fc-bridge pscale\"><div class=\"fcb-ends\"><div class=\"fcb-end\"></div><div class=\"fcb-mid\"><span>Forecast</span><strong>3.6%</strong></div><div class=\"fcb-end r\"></div></div><div class=\"ps-track\"><i class=\"ps-dot\" style=\"left:3.59%\"></i></div><div class=\"ps-ticks\"><span>0%</span><span>100%</span></div></div><table class=\"fc-table fc-cases\"><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\" class=\"cp-cond\"><span class=\"cp-role\">Condition</span><a class=\"go name\" data-go=\"prop:18\">China invades Taiwan <span class=\"cp-date\">by June 30, 2027</span></a></th><th class=\"r\">Probability</th><th class=\"r\">Chance</th><th class=\"r\">Contribution</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\">If Yes<span class=\"cp-sub\">Analyst input</span></th><td class=\"fc-math n\">2.5%</td><td class=\"fc-math n\">85.0%</td><td class=\"fc-val n\"><span class=\"n v\">2.1%</span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">If No<span class=\"cp-sub\">Analyst input</span></th><td class=\"fc-math n\">97.5%</td><td class=\"fc-math n\">1.5%</td><td class=\"fc-val n\"><span class=\"n v\">+1.5%</span></td></tr><tr class=\"tot\"><th scope=\"row\" colspan=\"1\">Forecast</th><td></td><td></td><td class=\"fc-val n\"><span class=\"n v\">3.6%</span></td></tr></tbody></table><h3 class=\"sub\">Rationale · If Yes</h3><div class=\"basis note\"><div class=\"fold\"><div class=\"fold-in\"><div class=\"md\" data-md=\"An invasion by June 30, 2027 would nearly always have begun, or been preceded by a blockade, by May 18: May 18 is 180 of the 223 days to June 30, and a blockade phase comes first in most invasion scenarios.\"><p>An invasion by June 30, 2027 would nearly always have begun, or been preceded by a blockade, by May 18: May 18 is 180 of the 223 days to June 30, and a blockade phase comes first in most invasion scenarios.</p></div></div><button class=\"linkish more\" type=\"button\" data-more>Show more</button></div></div><h3 class=\"sub\">Rationale · If No</h3><div class=\"basis note\"><div class=\"fold\"><div class=\"fold-in\"><div class=\"md\" data-md=\"A blockade, quarantine or strike that stops short of invasion. Polymarket&#x27;s &#x27;China blockade Taiwan in 2026&#x27; trades near 2% for six weeks, which is mostly the floor such longshots trade at; Bloomberg Economics calls heightened tension without a full crisis &#x27;the most probable near-term path&#x27;. Xi pressed Taiwan with Trump on Nov 19 (&#x27;the United States must keep doing the right thing to avoid the emergence of great turbulence&#x27;), which is pressure through Washington, not a sign of imminent force. I put it at 1.5% over six months.\"><p>A blockade, quarantine or strike that stops short of invasion. Polymarket&#x27;s &#x27;China blockade Taiwan in 2026&#x27; trades near 2% for six weeks, which is mostly the floor such longshots trade at; Bloomberg Economics calls heightened tension without a full crisis &#x27;the most probable near-term path&#x27;. Xi pressed Taiwan with Trump on Nov 19 (&#x27;the United States must keep doing the right thing to avoid the emergence of great turbulence&#x27;), which is pressure through Washington, not a sign of imminent force. I put it at 1.5% over six months.</p></div></div><button class=\"linkish more\" type=\"button\" data-more>Show more</button></div></div><p class=\"raw\"><a class=\"rawlink\" data-go=\"raw:value:structure:prop:2\">Full details</a></p>", "wide": true}